  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: MR.WHO
  lines:
  - The objects rest on top of the barrels.
  - "Simple wood, nothing more\u2026"
  - Yet even this act is not without meaning.
  - You must learn to use your surroundings.
  - Take one of these objects.
  - Strike a wooden bust.
  - It will not fight back.
  - "But remember\u2026"
  - ...what you do now is practice for what comes later.
